error[Z0401]: `check` cannot be called on a Frame
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:1
  |
1 | dataset(staff).check(dag { training -> productivity }, exposure: training)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this is a Frame
  |
  = help: `check` takes a RegFit, IvFit or GlmFit first; `x.check(...)` is `check(x, ...)`

error[Z0401]: `check` cannot be called on a TestResult
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:1
  |
1 | dataset(staff).t_test(productivity, by: training).check(dag { training -> productivity }, exposure: training)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this is a TestResult
  |
  = help: `check` takes a RegFit, IvFit or GlmFit first; `x.check(...)` is `check(x, ...)`
